                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This was, without a doubt, the last great Dynasty Warriors: Empires game I’ve played. While it does have its limitations, what I really like is the sheer variety of battle and conquest stories you can experience, whether as an adventurer, a soldier, a high-ranking commander, or a ruler (you can even become Emperor, though there isn’t really much of a difference. I feel a bit like Cao Pi in that regard).\n\nOf course, I only recommend this game if you’re planning to play it solo; as for the online mode, forget about it ¡I haven’t seen any sign of it in ages! 🤣",
